{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_01PqjYk3gbrXt41i7ayTa19T","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now let me do a final summary check of all plan phases:\n\n**Phase 0 - Preparation**: ✅ Feature branch approach is for the implementer - currently on develop with uncommitted changes (expected state for our environment)\n\n**Phase 1 - Bring docs into the repo**:\n- ✅ Step 1.1: `docs/` directory created with all required files\n- ✅ Step 1.2: `\"workspaces\": [\"docs\"]` added to root `package.json` (after `\"engines\"`)\n- ✅ Step 1.3: docs-side `bun.lock` removed\n- ✅ Step 1.4: `bun install` done, unified `bun.lock` at root\n- ✅ Step 1.5: Docs build verified\n\n**Phase 2 - Cross-repo references**:\n- ✅ Step 2.1: `\"docs/**/*\"` added to tsconfig exclude\n- ✅ Step 2.2: `DOCS_SCHEMA_DIR` updated in generate-schemas.ts\n- ✅ Step 2.3: Schema generation verified\n\n**Phase 3 - Strip lists**:\n- ✅ Step 3.1: `\"docs\"` added to `STRIP_DIRS` in sync-public.ts\n- ✅ Step 3.2: `delete pkg.workspaces` added to `transformPackageJson()`\n- ✅ Step 3.3: `\"docs/\"` added to `INTERNAL_FILES_TO_STRIP` in release.ts\n- ✅ Step 3.4: Release.ts schema handling for docs updated (3 changes)\n- ✅ Step 3.5: `--exclude='docs'` added to test-sync-local.ts rsync\n- ✅ Step 3.6: `\"docs\"` added to `shouldNotExist` in test-sync-local.ts\n\n**Phase 4 - .gitignore**:\n- ✅ Step 4.1: Docs-specific ignores added\n\n**Phase 5 - Documentation**:\n- ✅ Step 5.1: SOP repo structure updated\n- ✅ Step 5.2: SOP \"What gets stripped\" updated\n- ✅ Step 5.3: SOP Key Files Reference updated\n- ✅ Step 5.4: SOP Development Workflow section added\n\n**Phase 6 - Verification**: All verified above\n\nLet me now check if there's anything from the SOP Section 5.2 that requires a check - the \"note about workspaces\" in the strip description:"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":616,"cache_read_input_tokens":72026,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":616},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"72b4944f-9ed8-419f-b1b0-aa5790b55960","uuid":"dca093a5-6a92-4781-8338-5783c0197ed5","timestamp":"2026-03-05T13:58:45.300Z"}
